      "body": "chrome 插件安装地址：[add-qrcode-generator-icon-back-to-address-bar](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/add-qr-code-generator-ico/kacblhilkacgfnkjfodalohcnllcgmjd)\n\nchrome 插件项目地址：[add-qrcode-generator-icon-back-to-address-bar](https://github.com/chromium-style-qrcode/add-qrcode-generator-icon-back-to-address-bar)\n\n优势：\n1. 支持针对当前页面生成二维码，可以直接扫码、也可以直接复制转发给别人、甚至可以保存下来然后转发给别人\n2. 支持快捷键呼出\n3. 支持手动输入链接，然后自动生成二维码\n4. 支持移除恐龙图标\n\n可以看作是是草料二维码的平替\n\n![add-qrcode-generator-icon-back-to-address-bar](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f40b5c9f-4cd5-4436-b077-43880bcc5800)\n\n",
